<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping - Mangalore cargoes - Nov 6.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping - Mangalore cargoes - Nov 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Mangalore port on November 6:</p>
<p>  Commodity	     Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Bentonite	   1,025 (ULD)  1,975    Asha Global	5/11</p>
<p> Plywood		  84 (LDD)    228    Reef Pampa	 5/11</p>
<p> Muriate of Potash 1,270 (ULD)  9,491    Hun Jian	   1/11</p>
<p> Urea		  1,029 (ULD) 10,384    Sai Kung	   1/11</p>
<p> Granite		 415 (LDD)  2,285    Madras Express   5/11</p>
<p>Iron Ore</p>
<p>  Concentrate     39,000 (LDD) 21,000    Ispat Tarang     5/11</p>
<p> Motor Spirit	8,000 (LDD)  7,000    Jaag Preeti	5/11</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>ULD-Discharge</p>
<p>LDD-Loading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Mangalore)</p>
